OL,3,AUN watchdog 'increasingly concerned'
OL,4,Aover uninspected Iran nuclear site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UN's nuclear watchdog has said it
OL,7,Fis "increasingly concerned" about a
OL,8,Fnuclear facility in Iran which it has
OL,9,Fnot been allowed to inspect.
OL,11,FIran informed the International Atomic
OL,12,FEnergy Agency (IAEA) of plans to set up
OL,13,Fthe uranium enrichment plant in the
OL,14,Fcity of Isfahan a day before Israel
OL,15,Fbegan attacking its nuclear sites last
OL,16,FJune. The US joined the strikes later
OL,17,Fthat month.
OL,19,FIn a report seen by news agencies, the
OL,20,FIAEA said it does not know the exact
OL,21,Flocation or whether it contains nuclear
OL,22,Fmaterial.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
